#: profileciscooptionsbase4.ui:427 profileracoonoptionsbase4.ui:290
msgctxt ""
"Automatic keying has a property called perfect forward secrecy. This is the "
"Diffie Helman group for PFS."
msgid "Diffie Helman group for Perfect Forward Secrecy"
msgstr "\"Diffie Helman\"-Koppel för utwarkenfree Verslöteln"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, PerfectForwardSecrecyCombobox)
#. +> trunk
#: advancedprofiledialogbase4.ui:105 newprofilewizardracoon4.ui:314
#: profileciscooptionsbase4.ui:441 profileracoonoptionsbase4.ui:304
msgid ""
"This is the Diffie Helman group for PFS.\n"
"The following assignment will is used:\n"
"server = DH group is recieved from server (cisco only)\n"
"nopfs = no pfs is used\n"
"dh1 = modp768\n"
"dh2 = modp1024\n"
"dh5 = modp1536\n"
"d14 = modp2048 (racoon only)\n"
"dh15= modp3072 (racoon only)\n"
"dh16 = modp4096 (racoon only)\n"
"dh17 = modp6144 (racoon only)\n"
"dh18 = modp8192 (racoon only)"
msgstr ""
"Dit is de \"Diffie Hellman\"-Koppel för PFS.\n"
"Disse Towiesen warrt bruukt:\n"
"server = DH-Koppel vun'n Server kregen (bloots Cisco)\n"
"nopfs = keen pfs bruukt\n"
"dh1 = modp768\n"
"dh2 = modp1024\n"
"dh5 = modp1536\n"
"d14 = modp2048 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh15= modp3072 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh16 = modp4096 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh17 = modp6144 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh18 = modp8192 (bloots Racoon)"

