#: profileracoonoptionsbase4.ui:135 profileracoonoptionsbase4.ui:172
#: profileracoonoptionsbase4.ui:246
msgid "Diffie Hellman group"
msgstr "\"Diffie Hellman\"-Koppel"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, IkeGroupCombobox)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, DHGroupComboBox)
#. +> trunk
#: advancedprofiledialogbase4.ui:123 newprofilewizardracoon4.ui:260
#: profileciscooptionsbase4.ui:387 profileracoonoptionsbase4.ui:257
msgid ""
"This define the group used for the Diffie-Hellman exponentiations. The "
"following assignment is used:\n"
"dh1 = modp768\n"
"dh2 = modp1024\n"
"dh5 = modp1536\n"
"d14 = modp2048 (only racoon)\n"
"dh15 = modp3072 (only racoon)\n"
"dh16 = modp4096 (only racoon)\n"
"dh17 = modp6144 (only racoon)\n"
"dh18 = modp8192 (only racoon)"
msgstr ""
"Dit gifft den Koppel för \"Diffie-Hellman\"-Potenzeren an. Disse Towiesen "
"warrt bruukt:\n"
"dh1 = modp768\n"
"dh2 = modp1024\n"
"dh5 = modp1536\n"
"d14 = modp2048 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh15 = modp3072 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh16 = modp4096 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh17 = modp6144 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh18 = modp8192 (bloots Racoon)"

